    "If it still doesn't connect, check that Bluetooth and Wi-Fi are on for both devices." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Falls es immer noch nicht klappt, prüfe, ob Bluetooth und WLAN auf beiden Geräten aktiviert sind."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si aún no se conecta, comprueba que Bluetooth y Wi-Fi estén activados en ambos dispositivos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si la connexion échoue encore, vérifiez que le Bluetooth et le Wi-Fi sont activés sur les deux appareils."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se ancora non si collega, verifica che Bluetooth e Wi-Fi siano attivi su entrambi i dispositivi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "それでも接続できない場合は、両方のデバイスのBluetoothとWi‑Fiがオンか確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "그래도 연결되지 않으면 두 기기의 Bluetooth와 Wi-Fi가 켜져 있는지 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se ainda não conectar, verifique se o Bluetooth e o Wi-Fi estão ativados nos dois dispositivos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果还是连不上，请确认两台设备的蓝牙和 Wi-Fi 都已打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果還是連不上，請確認兩台裝置的藍牙和 Wi-Fi 都已開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you do, Rereminder can show the remaining time in your Mac menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dann kann Rereminder die Restzeit in der Menüleiste deines Macs anzeigen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si lo tienes, Rereminder puede mostrar el tiempo restante en la barra de menús de tu Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si oui, Rereminder peut afficher le temps restant dans la barre des menus de votre Mac."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se sì, Rereminder può mostrare il tempo rimanente nella barra dei menu del Mac."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "お持ちなら、Macのメニューバーにも残り時間を表示できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "있다면 Mac 메뉴 막대에서도 남은 시간을 볼 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se tiver, o Rereminder pode mostrar o tempo restante na barra de menus do Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有的话，Rereminder 也能在 Mac 菜单栏显示剩余时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有的話，Rereminder 也能在 Mac 選單列顯示剩餘時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you do, you can check the remaining time right on your wrist while the timer runs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dann siehst du die Restzeit direkt am Handgelenk, während der Timer läuft."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si lo tienes, puedes ver el tiempo restante en la muñeca mientras corre el temporizador."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si oui, vous pourrez voir le temps restant directement à votre poignet pendant que le minuteur tourne."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se sì, puoi controllare il tempo rimanente direttamente al polso mentre il timer è in corso."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "お持ちなら、タイマー中に手首で残り時間をすぐ確認できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "있다면 타이머가 도는 동안 손목에서 바로 남은 시간을 볼 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se tiver, você pode ver o tempo restante direto no pulso enquanto o timer roda."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有的话，计时进行中就能在手腕上直接看到剩余时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有的話，計時進行中就能在手腕上直接看到剩餘時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your Apple Watch alerts first and you don't respond, this iPhone joins in after 30 seconds. Stopping on either device stops both." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn deine Apple Watch zuerst erinnert und du nicht reagierst, stimmt dieses iPhone nach 30 Sekunden mit ein. Stoppen auf einem Gerät stoppt beide."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si tu Apple Watch avisa primero y no respondes, este iPhone se suma a los 30 segundos. Si lo detienes en cualquiera de los dos, se detienen ambos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si votre Apple Watch sonne d’abord et que vous ne répondez pas, cet iPhone prend le relais au bout de 30 secondes. Arrêter sur l’un des appareils arrête les deux."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se il tuo Apple Watch avvisa per primo e non rispondi, dopo 30 secondi si unisce anche questo iPhone. Fermandolo su un dispositivo si fermano entrambi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watchが先に通知し、反応がなければ30秒後にこのiPhoneも通知します。どちらのデバイスで停止しても両方止まります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch가 먼저 알리고 반응이 없으면 30초 뒤 이 iPhone도 함께 알려요. 어느 기기에서 정지해도 둘 다 멈춰요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se o Apple Watch alertar primeiro e você não responder, este iPhone entra junto após 30 segundos. Parar em qualquer um dos dois para ambos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch 先提醒，如果你没有回应，30 秒后这台 iPhone 也会一起响。在任一台设备上停止，两边都会停。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch 先提醒，如果你沒有回應，30 秒後這台 iPhone 也會一起響。在任一台裝置上停止，兩邊都會停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Impossible to ignore" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nicht zu überhören"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imposible de ignorar"
          }
