    "Tell us what you need or what felt off — the developer reads every message." : {
      "comment" : "Feedback nudge message",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sag uns, was dir fehlt oder was sich komisch angefühlt hat – der Entwickler liest jede Nachricht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuéntanos qué necesitas o qué no te convenció; el desarrollador lee todos los mensajes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dites-nous ce qui vous manque ou ce qui vous a gêné : le développeur lit chaque message."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dicci cosa ti serve o cosa non ti ha convinto: lo sviluppatore legge ogni messaggio."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "必要な機能や気になった点を送っていただければ、開発者が直接読んで反映します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "필요한 기능이나 아쉬웠던 점을 남겨주시면 개발자가 직접 읽고 반영할게요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conte o que você precisa ou o que não ficou bom — o desenvolvedor lê todas as mensagens."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "告诉我们你需要什么、哪里不顺手 — 每一条留言开发者都会读。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "告訴我們你需要什麼、哪裡不順手 — 每一則留言開發者都會讀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
