            "value" : "Da última vez: %1$@ com %2$lld alertas. O Pro salva isso com os nomes e roteiros das etapas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上次是 %1$@、%2$lld 个提醒。Pro 可以连同分段名称和讲稿一起保存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上次是 %1$@、%2$lld 個提醒。Pro 可以連同分段名稱和講稿一起儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've run %@ with %lld alerts on different days. Pro saves it with your section names and scripts, ready for the next session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast %1$@ mit %2$lld Erinnerungen an verschiedenen Tagen genutzt. Pro sichert es mit deinen Abschnittsnamen und Skripten – bereit für die nächste Session."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You've run %1$@ with %2$lld alerts on different days. Pro saves it with your section names and scripts, ready for the next session."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has usado %1$@ con %2$lld avisos en días distintos. Pro lo guarda con los nombres y guiones de tus secciones, listo para la próxima sesión."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous avez lancé %1$@ avec %2$lld alertes sur plusieurs jours. Pro l’enregistre avec les noms de vos parties et vos notes, prêt pour la prochaine séance."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hai usato %1$@ con %2$lld avvisi in giorni diversi. Pro lo salva con i nomi delle sezioni e i copioni, pronto per la prossima sessione."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "別々の日に %1$@・通知 %2$lld 個で使いました。Proなら区間名と台本まで一緒に保存して、次のセッションですぐ使えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "서로 다른 날에 %1$@, 알림 %2$lld개로 쓰셨어요. Pro는 구간 이름과 대본까지 함께 저장해 다음 세션에 바로 꺼내 씁니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você usou %1$@ com %2$lld alertas em dias diferentes. O Pro salva isso com os nomes e roteiros das etapas, pronto para a próxima sessão."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在不同的日子用过 %1$@、%2$lld 个提醒。Pro 可以连同分段名称和讲稿一起保存，下次直接调用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在不同的日子用過 %1$@、%2$lld 個提醒。Pro 可以連同分段名稱和講稿一起儲存，下次直接套用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your %@ setup with %lld alerts is back on the dial. Pro saves setups like this with your section names and scripts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Setup %1$@ mit %2$lld Erinnerungen ist wieder auf dem Zifferblatt. Pro sichert solche Setups mit deinen Abschnittsnamen und Skripten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your %1$@ setup with %2$lld alerts is back on the dial. Pro saves setups like this with your section names and scripts."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu configuración de %1$@ con %2$lld avisos está de nuevo en el dial. Pro guarda configuraciones como esta con los nombres y guiones de tus secciones."
          }
